  "content": "\n\n<p><img alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1004/811/warlord_logo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1408\" height=\"940\"><img src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1TuMYlrd5-0tAovpB4ppELNyieue05MXD/view?usp=drive_link\" alt=\"\"><img alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/740/990/genesislogo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2047\" height=\"572\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">一段被遺忘的故事</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1452/324/warlord_completed-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"590\" height=\"883\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">公告：我將重做本模組中的「地獄領主」。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">將擁有全新的獨特模型、技能及更多內容！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\">加入我們的 Discord 伺服器！&darr;</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/XFfUjwD6xa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1006/433/3a8feb0e279d07a02c91451aebf4dba91263075a-1140x620.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1044\"></span></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"color:#f00\">警告：目前仍為測試版</span><span style=\"color:#f00\">。距離正式完成尚早。</span></span></p>\n<p>模組展示：</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/RJU6lbceZug?si=MKdTQvK8uC3yR3rx\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px;color:#000\">使用 IntelliJ 重新製作</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#000;font-family:&amp;#x27\">關於本模組的公告：地獄領主即將進行重做！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">將包含新模型／材質、攻擊方式，以及專屬的全新結構！</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">現有首領：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 鮭魚首領 <span style=\"color:#f00\">（開發中）</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 地獄領主</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 不死巨像</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 宇宙史蒂夫 <span style=\"color:#f00\">（開發中）</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">現有生物：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 地獄幽靈</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">現有結構：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 凋靈基地</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">現有物品：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 模組實體清除器</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 領主刷怪籠</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 領主戰鎚</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 音樂唱片（魔界交響曲 - 決鬥）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 所有刷怪蛋</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">備註：<br>- 建議在遊玩充滿回憶的世界時，將<span style=\"color:#f00\">\"mobGriefing\"</span>設為<span style=\"color:#f00\">\"false\"</span>。不死巨像、宇宙史蒂夫等會破壞相對脆弱的方塊（硬度低於礦石方塊）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 無需額外模組支援。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">特別感謝：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000;font-family:&amp;#x27\">不死巨像材質來源：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmob-skin%252fimmortal-totem%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.planetminecraft.com/mob-skin/immortal-totem/</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000;font-family:&amp;#x27\">太陽能束程式碼參考：<a href=\"https://github.com/BobMowzie/MowziesMobs\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/BobMowzie/MowziesMobs</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">掉落方塊與首領血條程式碼：L_Ender's Cataclysm</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">地獄領主主題音樂來源：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252fyoutu.be%252fTJL23TSToXk%253fsi%253dUhpYitAgL6eRXFnQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://youtu.be/TJL23TSToXk?si=UhpYitAgL6eRXFnQ</a></span></span></p>\n</div>",
